 llvm/lib/Analysis/SingleThreaded.cpp          | 74 ++++++++++++++++---
 llvm/test/Analysis/SingleThreaded/swmr.ll     | 12 ++-
 .../single-threaded-creator-callee.ll         | 44 +++++++++++
 .../single-threaded-linkage.ll                | 50 +++++++++++++
 .../ThreadSanitizerNew/swmr-linkage.ll        | 31 ++++++++
